  "prefLabel": "Sphc 201.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 201.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure. The Plc 200 rules shall govern with regards to:\n\n(a) Adjudicatory proceedings;\n\n(b) Rulemaking submissions, considerations, and dispositions of rulemaking petitions;\n\n(c) Public comment hearings;\n\n(d) Declaratory rulings;\n\n(e) Explanation of adopted rules;\n\n(f) Voluntary surrender of licenses; and\n\n(g) Waivers of administrative rules.\n\nSource. #14192, eff 2-12-25\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sphc200.html"
}
